[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0128","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0128.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1593","title":"GNUA2PS 不安全文件创建漏洞","description":"a2ps 4.14 及更早版本中的 lib/routines.h 文件 tempname_ensure 函数存在不安全的临时文件创建漏洞（CWE-59），spy_user 函数及其他可能函数调用该函数时未正确验证临时文件路径真实性，导致本地攻击者可通过在临时目录创建恶意符号链接，劫持临时文件写入操作，从而修改攻击者可访问的任意文件。该漏洞影响 GNU a2ps 4.14 及更早版本，攻击向量为本地（AV:L），攻击复杂度低（AC:L），无需认证（Au:N），仅影响完整性（I:P），CVSS 评分 2.1（LOW 级）。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1593"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2014-04-05T21:55:06Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:33Z","remediation":"建议升级 a2ps 至 4.15 或更高版本（已修复 tempname_ensure 函数的不安全临时文件创建漏洞）。若无法升级，请应用各发行版提供的补丁：Debian 请应用 deb_2892 补丁，Gentoo 应用 a2ps-4.14-CVE-2001-1593.patch，Frugalware 应用 CVE-2001-1593.patch，pkgsrc 用户应用 patch-CVE-2001-1593_1。临时缓解措施：设置 TMPDIR 环境变量指向仅当前用户可写的目录（如 /tmp/user_$UID），并设置 sticky bit（chmod 1777 /tmp/user_$UID），防止本地用户通过符号链接攻击临时文件。建议通过包管理器升级：Debian/Ubuntu 执行 apt update && apt upgrade a2ps，Gentoo 执行 emerge -u a2ps，Fedora/RHEL 执行 dnf update a2ps。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://pkgs.fedoraproject.org/cgit/a2ps.git/plain/a2ps-4.13-security.patch","http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2014/q1/237","http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2014/q1/253","http://seclists.org/oss-sec/2014/q1/257","http://www.debian.org/security/2014/dsa-2892","https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=737385","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1060630","https://github.com/jsonn/pkgsrc/blob/c1514b5f4a3726d90e30aa16b0c209adbc276d17/print/a2ps/patches/patch-CVE-2001-1593_1","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7102a069678e6b88d270e4c0da51e40aee59b148/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1593.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1593","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bb6cd0f1a29580d840cdb570b8b0c57cc39aac6d/osv/cve/2001/UBUNTU-CVE-2001-1593.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1593.md","https://github.com/frugalware/kde5/blob/5d51d2db65802d1cae2ee918816f9ca6a6b550f4/source/apps-extra/a2ps/CVE-2001-1593.patch","https://github.com/gnummers/gentoo-optimized/blob/3b1c3b513005aef0f21480f98a42941c3213c47e/usr/portage/app-text/a2ps/files/a2ps-4.14-CVE-2001-1593.patch","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5acf8b684d0e9ea76142eea6cd4851531d4ab2af/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1593.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2001-1593","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2014/deb_2892.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0128.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0568","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0568.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1586","title":"SimpleServer WWW 目录遍历漏洞","description":"tags, no other content.<value>SimpleServer:WWW 1.13及更早版本（包括1.0.7、1.0.8）存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在请求的URL中使用十六进制编码的\"../\"序列（%2E%2E%2F%）绕过服务器对目录路径的过滤校验，向cgi-bin/目录发送恶意请求。成功利用该漏洞可导致攻击者在目标Windows系统上执行任意程序，造成完全的系统控制。该漏洞影响AnalogX开发的SimpleServer:WWW轻量级HTTP服务器，攻击者无需身份认证即可在任意目标上发起远程利用，CVSS评分高达10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1586"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2010-02-12T21:30:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:33Z","remediation":"立即升级 SimpleServer:WWW 至 AnalogX 官方发布的 v1.15 或更高版本（最新稳定版 v1.24），该版本已修复 cgi-bin 目录下的目录遍历漏洞。若无法立即升级，可在 IIS 或其他反向代理层配置 URL 重写规则，拒绝包含 %2E%2E%2F 或 .. 路径片段的请求，或直接禁用 cgi-bin 目录的远程访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2001/Jul/660","http://www.analogx.com/contents/download/network/sswww.htm","http://www.securiteam.com/windowsntfocus/5TP0B1P4UK.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3112","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/56631","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21039","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1930d8e9c9119e24dda550971a0deb081f5af159/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1586.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1586","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1586.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0f7d9238ba77f900663100d40113352eb3a480d7/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1586.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/8fd24b26179bcdde52e301aef6d16b0838932c28/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4j79-c8mg-c35x/GHSA-4j79-c8mg-c35x.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1586.md","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/simplewww.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_110100_110200.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5f9d7529-ceda-4dfb-8b5e-637b4cafa521.json","https://github.com/InfoSecWarrior/Vulnerable-Box-Resources/blob/c784bcf63e1ec5c3a0116043d8653d00f0a21a0b/Vulnhub/OZ/oz-1-nikto-8080-output.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0568.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0111","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1413","title":"ncompress comprexx 函数栈缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"ncompress 4.2.4 及更早版本中的 comprexx 函数存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。当该库被用于跨越安全边界的场景（如 FTP 服务器处理文件名参数）时，远程攻击者可通过向目标服务提交超长文件名参数触发栈缓冲区溢出，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响广泛使用 ncompress 压缩库的各类服务和应用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1413"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2004-12-23T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:13Z","remediation":"升级 ncompress 至 4.2.4-r1 及以上版本。Gentoo 系统执行 `emerge \">=app-arch/ncompress-4.2.4-r1\"`；Red Hat 系统安装 RHSA-2004-536 提供的更新包。如无法升级，避免在 FTP 等跨安全边界场景中使用 ncompress 处理不可信文件名参数。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/lists/vuln-dev/2001/Nov/0202.html","http://security.gentoo.org/glsa/glsa-200410-08.xml","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/176363","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2004-536.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10619","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1413.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1413","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1413.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2001-1413","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2001-1413","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1413.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/83b6758c208f8fd7e22b7c88e002c3658ef467b8/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2001-1413","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1413.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8c49be67bcdc4426e8ef0f9e3bc9fef14227d04f/2001/CVE-2001-1413.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1413.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0547","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0547.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1412","title":"Apple MacOS X nidump密码文件泄露漏洞","description":"MacOS X 10.3 之前版本中的 nidump 工具存在敏感信息泄漏漏洞。本地攻击者可通过在命令行中指定 passwd 参数，利用 nidump 读取系统密码文件中的加密密码哈希值。该漏洞源于 nidump 未对命令行参数进行充分的权限检查，导致普通用户也能访问本应受保护的口令数据。攻击者获取加密密码后可通过离线破解方式获得明文密码，进而提升系统权限。该漏洞影响 MacOS X 10.3 之前的所有版本，攻击者需具有本地系统访问权限。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1412"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-11-17T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:13Z","remediation":"升级至 Mac OS X 10.3 (Panther) 或更高版本，该版本已修复 nidump 允许普通用户读取加密密码文件的问题。如无法立即升级，可移除 nidump 的 setuid 位（chmod u-s /usr/bin/nidump）并限制仅管理员可执行，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.apple.com/mhonarc/security-announce/msg00038.html","http://lists.insecure.org/lists/bugtraq/2002/Sep/0128.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99953038722104&w=2","http://securitytracker.com/id?1001946","http://www.securemac.com/macosxnidump.php","http://www.securiteam.com/securityreviews/5QP032A4UU.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20984","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1412.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1412","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1412.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1412.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ba518c3d2e41cb46015251f8c5b067b05ea0ba59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4xg9-r6jc-wpcq/GHSA-4xg9-r6jc-wpcq.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1412.md","https://github.com/tumblr1978/SecurityDataUsage/blob/fbec2cf82c02c3a21131dc1c1bc5d2c453e004c4/papersTotalTXT/sec12-final227.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1412.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--14c6f652-6f75-4af0-b7bf-34b41894c30a.json","https://github.com/michael1981/sfish_pt/blob/14f609d56e35e9810a1de14712293ab47cc03a46/%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%2B%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%2B%E7%88%86%E7%A0%B4/X-Scan-v3.3/plugins/netinfo_passwd.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0547.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0547.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0547.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0546","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0546.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1410","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5/6 JavaScript 接口欺骗漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5/6 存在 JavaScript 接口欺骗漏洞，攻击者可利用 `window.createPopup()` 方法创建无边框、无标题栏的色块窗口（chromeless window），模拟合法的系统对话框、登录框或安全警告等界面元素。由于缺少浏览器原生 UI 标识（如地址栏、状态栏、安全锁图标），用户难以辨别真伪，从而被诱导输入敏感信息（账号密码、信用卡号等）或执行非预期操作。该漏洞影响 IE 5、IE 6 及更早版本，属于客户端欺骗类漏洞，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），攻击向量为网络、低复杂度、无需认证，主要造成机密性部分泄露。利用方式为构造恶意网页诱导受害者访问，结合社会工程学手段实施钓鱼攻击。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1410"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2003-08-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:13Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Internet Explorer 5/6 等已停止支持的浏览器，升级至 Microsoft Edge、Google Chrome、Mozilla Firefox 等现代浏览器最新版本。若因兼容性原因必须使用 IE，请在“Internet 选项”→“安全”→“自定义级别”中将“活动脚本”设为“禁用”或“提示”，并将受信任站点安全级别设为“高”，同时部署网络层面的 URL 过滤策略拦截可疑链接，防止钓鱼页面利用 window.createPopup() 进行欺骗攻击。Microsoft 已于 2016 年 1 月停止对 IE 8/9/10 的安全更新，建议通过 Windows Update 升级至受支持的 Windows 10/11 并使用 Edge 浏览器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105820229407274&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=105829174431769&w=2",