/AVE-2001-0546.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0537","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0537.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1409","title":"XFree86 Xserver dexconf /dev/dri 目录权限设置不安全漏洞","description":"XFree86 Xserver 4.1.0-2 中的 dexconf 脚本在创建 /dev/dri 目录时使用了不安全的权限设置（666），导致所有本地用户均可对该目录进行读写操作。本地攻击者可利用此权限配置缺陷，在 /dev/dri 目录中替换或创建恶意文件，进而影响根文件系统的完整性。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限，无法远程利用，CVSS 评分 3.6，危害等级低。受影响的版本包括 XFree86 Xserver 4.1.0-2，建议升级到修复版本或手动修正 /dev/dri 目录权限。","severity":"LOW","score":3.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1409"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2003-07-24T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:13Z","remediation":"升级 XFree86 至 4.1.0 补丁版本（Red Hat Enterprise Linux 2.1 用户安装 RHSA-2003:065 更新包），或手动将 /dev/dri 目录权限修正为 755（chmod 755 /dev/dri），并检查 dexconf 脚本确保启动时不再错误设置权限。Sun Solaris 用户应安装 Sun 补丁 228529-1。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://groups.google.com/groups?selm=20010829121505.A16004%40compusol.com.au","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-66-228529-1","http://sunsolve.sun.com/search/document.do?assetkey=1-77-1017429.1-1","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-067.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0db929612f090dc6aa0346061c42364c4634c480/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1409.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1409","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1409.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1409.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vxcv-7c4v-fmj9/GHSA-vxcv-7c4v-fmj9.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/redhat-RHSA-2003-065.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1409.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1409.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_147200_147300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c39f44ce-0c0c-45d7-93d3-a99d43d528d5.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0537.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0529","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0529.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1334","title":"PHPSlash 0.5.3/0.6.1 URL Block 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"PHPSlash 0.6.1 的 Block_render_url.class 组件存在任意文件读取漏洞。具有 PHPSlash 管理员权限的远程攻击者可通过创建 block 并将目标文件路径指定为 source URL，从而读取服务器上的任意敏感文件（如配置文件、密码文件等），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞利用条件要求攻击者已获取管理员权限，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1334"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-05-19T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:03Z","remediation":"升级 PHPSlash 至最新版本 0.8.1.1（2006 年发布），该版本修复了 URL Block 模块中任意文件读取漏洞。如无法升级，立即限制 blockAdmin.php3 页面的访问权限，仅允许超级管理员（GOD 权限）访问；同时移除所有非管理员用户的 URL Block 编辑权限，防止攻击者通过创建 URL 类型区块并指定任意文件路径（如 ./config.php3）读取 Web 服务器可访问的敏感文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0126.html","http://marc.info/?l=phpslash&m=99029398904419&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9990.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2724","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20848","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1334.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1334","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/5ea14f17ec38fb7850c23056beec64877fabc5b1/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1334.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bb772dcb04525a1a88049530e1b1081f8633cb88/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1334.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6hg6-qqqm-57rh/GHSA-6hg6-qqqm-57rh.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1334.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148400_148500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1334.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7cc57618-c199-438e-aa1e-28af73ff219c.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/dc712452b4b330ce9a69a7312562b32027c700f5/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0529.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0529.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0529.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0474","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0474.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1165","title":"Intego FileGuard 弱密码加密漏洞","description":"Intego FileGuard 2.0 及 4.0 版本使用弱加密算法存储用户信息和密码，本地攻击者可通过 Disengage 等工具解密存储的凭据数据，从而获取提升后的系统权限。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需身份认证即可利用，影响系统机密性、完整性和可用性。受影响用户应升级至修复版本或采取额外加密措施保护敏感信息。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1165"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-04-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:42Z","remediation":"升级到 Intego FileGuard 最新版本（若厂商已停止支持则建议迁移至 macOS 内置的 FileVault 加密方案）。临时缓解措施：限制本地用户对密码存储文件的读取权限，并启用物理访问控制防止攻击者运行 Disengage 等解密工具。","status":