文件在部分场景下被设置为全局可读。此漏洞使本地攻击者无需额外权限即可读取密码哈希数据，进而通过暴力破解手段尝试获取用户密码。攻击条件为攻击者需具备本地账户访问权限，影响范围涵盖使用 util-linux 2.10 之前版本的 Linux 发行版系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1175"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-04-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:43Z","remediation":"升级 util-linux 到 ≥2.10 版本以修复 /etc/shadow 权限漏洞，然后验证 root 所有文件权限已正确设置，不再 world-readable。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-095.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-132.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3036","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6851","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1175.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1175","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1175.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1175.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fb70ff2c257f1ca47c72f5b8b5d913d0de6cca53/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cmf2-f2q8-mr4f/GHSA-cmf2-f2q8-mr4f.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1175.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1175.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--b04888a3-bb90-4fe3-ae3f-1d117c80d736.json","https://github.com/animalyoung/attackmap/blob/c35b10ce77b910d0e12302802f22b79bd3fcbde0/attack_map/resources/views/onemap/Asia/bruteresult.txt","https://github.com/dmc5179/rhsa-tools/blob/677b19c223fe2771414f7b2fc89b4a4f39d25719/cvrfs/RHSA-2001:095.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0374.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0374.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0372","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0372.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1174","title":"Elm 2.5.5 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"Elm 邮件客户端（2.5.5 及更早版本）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过发送包含超长 Message-ID 头部的特制电子邮件触发该漏洞，无需身份认证即可在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响所有使用 Elm 2.5.5 及之前版本的用户，攻击条件宽松，利用方式简单，危害等级较高。漏洞于 2002 年 4 月 1 日由 NVD 正式发布。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1174"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-04-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:43Z","remediation":"立即升级到 Elm 2.14 或更高版本，完全修复缓冲区溢出漏洞；修改 /etc/elm/elm.rc 文件，禁用自动加载主题功能并限制 Message-ID 头部长度至 1024 字节以下；如无法立即升级，可通过 iptables 策略阻止源端口 143 的SMTP流量进行临时缓解","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-25T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-067.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5451","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-091.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6852","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3290bfd28d98351fcc1665e3427425a500ba46e2/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1174.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1174","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7679da85bd348992f49e2c46d2198526392248ee/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1174.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad51007022161bcf4c63e713af3138cc91fa14f3/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1174.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/64db5db4a6681c330f93cc62718610a5bc70bd7a/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2wqx-2fx4-v9vv/GHSA-2wqx-2fx4-v9vv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-1174.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-067.nasl","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148300_148400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/ebc4d73723464668b97400aaa2d8410c6ff78a81/nvdcve/CVE-2001-1174.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--86b78d9e-0fdb-4810-befb-fa6d061670eb.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0372.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0494","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0494.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1377","title":"多款 RADIUS 实现 Vendor-Specific 属性拒绝服务漏洞","description":"多种 RADIUS 实现（包括 Xtradius 1.1 Pre1/Pre2 等版本）在处理 Vendor-Specific 属性时未正确校验 Vendor-Length 字段，当该字段值小于 2 时触发越界读取，导致服务进程崩溃。远程攻击者无需认证即可通过向 RADIUS 服务发送特制的认证或计费请求包触发此漏洞，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响大量使用 RADIUS 协议的网络接入设备与认证服务器。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1377"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-03-04T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:09Z","remediation":"建议立即升级受影响的 RADIUS 服务端软件：Cistron Radius 升级到 1.6.6 或更高版本，FreeRADIUS 升级到 0.4 或更高版本，GnuRADIUS 升级到 0.96 或更高版本，XTRADIUS 升级到 1.2.1 或更高版本，YARD Radius 升级到 1.0.20 或更高版本，Radiator 升级到 2.6 或更高版本。Red Hat Linux 用户应安装 RHSA-2002-030 安全更新。FreeBSD 用户应升级到 4.5-RELEASE 或更新版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在网络边界防火墙配置规则过滤 Vendor-Length 异常的 RADIUS 数据包（UDP 1812/1813 端口）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2002-q2/0362.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000466","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101537153021792&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-06.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/8354.php","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/936683","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-030.html"