pdated":"2026-06-16T21:56:08Z","remediation":"建议立即升级受影响的 RADIUS 实现：Cistron RADIUS 升级至 1.6.6 或更高版本，FreeRADIUS 升级至 0.4 或更高版本，GnuRADIUS 升级至 0.96 或更高版本，YARD RADIUS 升级至 1.0.20 或更高版本，radiusclient 升级至 0.3.2 或更高版本。Red Hat Linux 用户应安装 RHSA-2002-030 安全更新。Lucent/Ascend RADIUS 用户可从 ftp://ftp.vergenet.net/pub/radius 获取非官方补丁。如无法立即升级，应在网络边界防火墙限制对 RADIUS 服务器（UDP 1812/1813 端口）的外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/suse/2002-q2/0362.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000466","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=101537153021792&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/239784","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-06.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/589523","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-030.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3530","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7534","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1376.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1376","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/41644568d1e47f962c2cefae75c8b09359290a26/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1376.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j9hg-49pv-5qq8/GHSA-j9hg-49pv-5qq8.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/radius_detect.nasl","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/73cd39be077fdbedc5ca2ea7e2723723d25285cc/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1376.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1376.md","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148200_148300.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/84ab05ca18ca7c09c367573254a7138efcaab49a/2001/CVE-2001-1376.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/74384c0908702bccef653ea01534b2305b3a5ca4/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0493.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0339","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0339.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0887","title":"xSANE xSANE 临时文件安全漏洞","description":"xSANE 0.81 及更早版本在处理临时文件时存在不安全的符号链接处理缺陷，本地攻击者可通过在共享临时目录中创建指向其他用户文件的恶意符号链接，诱导 xSANE 以目标用户权限打开并写入该链接指向的文件，从而实现跨用户边界的任意文件修改。攻击前提要求攻击者具备本地系统访问权限，并能预测或控制 xSANE 创建临时文件的路径与时机，利用竞争条件在文件创建与打开的时间窗口内替换符号链接目标。成功利用将导致受害用户文件被篡改、覆盖或破坏，破坏多用户环境下的文件隔离机制，虽 CVSS 仅 1.2 分（低危），但在共享扫描服务器等多用户场景下仍具实质破坏潜力。建议升级至 xSANE 0.82 以上版本，或配置粘滞位保护 /tmp 目录、设置私有 TMPDIR 等缓解措施。","severity":"LOW","score":1.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0887"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-01-15T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:09Z","remediation":"建议升级 xSANE 至 0.82 或更高版本（Debian 用户可通过 apt upgrade xsane 获取 DSA-706 修复版本）。临时缓解措施：为 /tmp 目录设置粘滞位（chmod +t /tmp），限制普通用户只能删除自己的临时文件；或在用户环境中设置 TMPDIR 指向用户私有目录（如 ~/tmp 且 chmod 700），避免在共享临时目录创建可预测文件名。若无法升级，建议限制 xSANE 仅由受信用户使用，或通过 AppArmor/SELinux 策略限制其对 /tmp 的写入权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2001-171.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-172.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/advisories/3734","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3700","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7714","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0887.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0887","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0887.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0887.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8x27-5m5c-3wv8/GHSA-8x27-5m5c-3wv8.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0887.md","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/D/debian_DSA-706.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0887.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_148200_148300.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1c39b261-6fd9-4a21-93aa-041979d0b63d.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0339.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0567","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0567.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1583","title":"Solaris LPD 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Solaris 8 及更早版本中的 lpd 守护进程（in.lpd）存在远程命令执行漏洞。该漏洞源于 lpd 在处理打印任务请求时会调用邮件程序发送通知邮件，攻击者可通过提交特制的控制文件，在 lpd 调用邮件程序时注入恶意指令，从而在无需身份认证的情况下执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞影响 Sun Solaris 8.0 及之前所有版本，攻击者只需能够访问目标系统的 LPD 服务端口（515/TCP），即可远程利用此漏洞获取系统最高权限。Metasploit 框架中已包含该漏洞的利用模块，攻击者可通过构造级联打印任务请求配合恶意邮件配置文件的方式触发漏洞执行，最终获得目标系统的完全控制权。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1583"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:33Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Solaris 9 或更高版本，或安装 Sun 安全补丁（Solaris 8 应用 112438-02，Solaris 7 应用 112439-02），消除 in.lpd 守护进程中的命令注入漏洞。如暂无法升级或打补丁，且无需打印服务，可通过 svcadm disable svc:/application/print/server:default 禁用 LPD 服务，并在防火墙层面封禁 TCP 515 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99929694701826&w=2","http://metasploit.com/projects/Framework/modules/exploits/solaris_lpd_exec.pm","http://www.derkeiler.com/Mailing-Lists/securityfocus/incidents/2001-08/0490.html","http://www.osvdb.org/15131","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3274","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/7087","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/16322","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2001/CVE-2001-1583.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/34c140d2b813dc095e2cd5ddc5f4caa934ff1f07/2001/CVE-2001-1583.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1583","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1583.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/9f33e551f5d4c0bb4df8de596869fddfb4c874cc/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1583.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4xc7-h5vr-gqmj/GHSA-4xc7-h5vr-gqmj.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2000/CVE-2000-1220.md","https://github.com/Chudry/Xerror/blob/07ec57cabcd27cdb47c89af452bdf4ed07207347/xerror/parsing/msf_module_result/msf_module_cve.txt","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/61a029b6511620ca4b0f0144ecf0f6b5056f65f9/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0567.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0566","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0566.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1582","title":"Sun Solaris 8 libsldap 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sun Solaris 8 系统的 LDAP 命名服务库（libsldap）存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可通过向使用 libsldap 的特权程序传递超长的 LDAP_OPTIONS 环境变量触发栈缓冲区溢出，从而以该程序权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Solaris 8 系统，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用，成功利用后可完全控制受影响的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1582"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-12-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:56:33Z","remediation":"安装 Sun 针对 Solaris 8 libsldap 缓冲区溢出漏洞的官方补丁：SPARC 平台安装补丁 108993-xx 或更高版本，x86 平台安装补丁 108994-xx 或更高版本。如无法立即打补丁，可临时移除受影响 setuid 程序的 setuid 位（chmod 755 /usr/bin/passwd /usr/bin/nispasswd /usr/bin/yppasswd /usr/bin/chkey），或将 /usr/lib/libsldap.so.1 替换为哑元库以禁用 LDAP 功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2001/Jul/0077.html","http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2001/Jul/0091.html","http://seclists.org/bugtraq/2001/Jun/0365.html","http://www.securiteam.com/unixfocus/5IP0O2A4KS.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2931","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20970","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1582.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1582","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/47b3b393e16caede3350b5302035c4ef73c36bc7/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1582.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ad8af7b6d55e05f22d7ff67c808ccd8d54c89d32/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-1582.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/c55392b715d0e2e1caa8bc26997a940be7494a13/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g5hh-655f-w2v3/GHSA-g5hh-655f-w2v3.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2001-1582.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1582.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_1.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-ope